# Production safety

```text
❌ Default credentials or secret fallbacks in application code
❌ Placeholder secrets accepted when NODE_ENV=production
✅ New env vars → env.validation.ts + matching .env.example + md/deploy.md in the same change
✅ Both apps must always ship a complete .env.example
```

Seed in production requires explicit admin credentials; no default passwords or e2e viewer user.
